[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700500_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700500_01_0010","text":"翻开题目卡，围绕该话题进行讨论\n——这次的卡片是……『男生』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700500_01_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700500_01_0020","text":"男生……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700500_01_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700500_01_0030","text":"关于男生的……什么！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700500_01_0040","text":"生态之类的？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700500_01_0050","text":"生态……呵呵……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700500_01_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700500_01_0060","text":"嘛，对我们来说最近的男生的话——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700500_01_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700500_01_0070","text":"制作人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700500_01_0080","text":"先不管年龄算不算男生……\n制作人的生态是……什么！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700500_01_0090","text":"活动场所是事务所，主食是咖啡……\n然后……还有什么——？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700500_01_0100","text":"等等，三峰们\n意外地不怎么了解制作人的生态不是吗……？"}]
